 ## Background
-Neural Textures was introduced in the paper "Material and Lighting Reconstruction for Complex Indoor Scenes with Texture-space Differentiable Rendering" [S1]. The method builds on deferred neural rendering techniques [TZN19] and aims to produce physically based textures that can be used in traditional rendering pipelines [S1]. It utilizes a differentiable path tracer (Mitsuba 2) for optimization [S1].
+Neural Textures was introduced in the paper "Material and Lighting Reconstruction for Complex Indoor Scenes with Texture-space Differentiable Rendering" [S2]. The method builds on deferred neural rendering techniques [S2] and aims to produce physically based textures that can be used in traditional rendering pipelines [S2]. It utilizes a differentiable path tracer (Mitsuba 2) for optimization [S2].
 
